-<title id="title">Five imperfect layers. Fewer escapes.</title>
-<desc id="desc">Five Swiss-cheese defence layers: risk tiering, multi-seat review, disposition gates, external rules, and tests proven to fail when behaviour is removed. A rare aligned escape enters an escape ledger, which feeds new mechanical rules or tests. Intercept and escape ledgers make precision and recall observable; the model does not claim zero defects.</desc>
+<title id="title">Multiple checks, complementary coverage.</title>
+<desc id="desc">Five Swiss-cheese defence layers: risk tiering, multi-seat review, disposition gates, external rules, and tests proven to fail when behaviour is removed. A rare aligned escape enters an escape ledger, which feeds new mechanical rules or tests. Records of false alarms and missed defects inform improvements; the model does not claim zero defects.</desc>
